aining: Conduct training sessions to help users understand software features and functionality.\\n                -Team Collaboration: Escalate unresolved, complex bugs to the core development or QA teams.\\n                - Feedback Loop: Gather user feedback to help product managers and developers identify recurring issues.\" locator('//angular-editor[@formcontrolname=\\'responsibility\\']//div[@class=\\'angular-editor-textarea\\']')","uuid":"a4a957a8-bd7a-45c0-a950-bf8dff59cc3b","stop":1781508345951},{"status":"passed","statusDetails":{},"stage":"finished","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"start":1781508345952,"name":"Fill \"\\n                - Experience: 0 to 3+ years in software customer success, technical support, or quality assurance. \" locator('//angular-editor[@formcontrolname=\\'experience\\']//div[@class=\\'angular-editor-textarea\\']')","uuid":"30d1f20f-231f-4f61-9c9a-7f255c245b75","stop":1781508346091},{"status":"passed","statusDetails":{},"stage":"finished","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"start":1781508346094,"name":"Fill \"\\n                - Education: Typically requires a degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, BCA, or MCA.\" locator('//angular-editor[@formcontrolname=\\'qualification\\']//div[@class=\\'angular-editor-textarea\\']')","uuid":"825fb082-729b-4fdd-a56e-d0c3c5e5d040","stop":1781508346250},{"status":"passed","statusDetails":{},"stage":"finished","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"start":1781508346253,"name":"Fill \"\\n                - Technical Skills: Strong understanding of the Software Development Life Cycle (SDLC), database querying (SQL basics), \\n                and operating systems (Windows, Linux, or macOS).\\n                - Soft Skills: Excellent verbal and written communication, active problem-solving, \\n                and client relationship management.\" locator('//angular-editor[@formcontrolname=\\'skills\\']//div[@class=\\'angular-editor-textarea\\']')","uuid":"6d67a